# The error dialog for a game in more pieces than the cart's table holds
# (en_error_7, the longest dialog text with en_file_overflow): CLEAN BOOT,
# through the menu's test hook, of a 1 MB game (Hello.gba padded) in 62
# runs of clusters (as tests/fragmented.sh's refused case), in the light
# theme.
#! settings 28=1
#! sd-fragmented /Frag.gba 0x100000 62 tests/roms/hello/hello.gba
#! expect-error error 7:
-w "nav: home ready"
-P "@8:nav_test_path:/Frag.gba" -p @8:nav_test_action:1
-w "screen ready: dialog"
-s @1:dialog.png
